      "value": "@{62b61f8ec938a62475e4cd14|full_name}\n\nThis is the world where the issue was confirmed (since the world isn't localized into English, it might be best for staff who understand Japanese to check).\n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/launch?worldId=wrld_e51f12e5-7bb4-4766-b654-238457cab62d\n\nI don't use steam-audio-beta, so I can't say for sure.\n\nHowever, I've confirmed that other users are reporting similar issues on X (Twitter) and elsewhere (such as distant users' voices sounding like they're speaking right next to your ear, which closely resembles this case).",
