      "value": "@{62b61f8ec938a62475e4cd14|full_name}\n\nYes, I've uploaded a video showing the actual issue when it occurs, so I'll share it.\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SMU9uMTm33U\n\nAs you can hear from the player's voice in the video, there are scenes where the sound seems to be skewed to one side or the other.\n\nWhen this happens, unless you rejoin the world, the way all 3D audio sources sound within the world becomes distorted.\n\nAdditionally, I'll include some screenshots of the UDON transceiver feature implemented in this world.\n\nThe UDON shown in the image is one example of a method that allows all players to hear each other's voices, no matter how far apart they are.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
